eng Lv, Xin Jiang, Xiuhong Fei, Xiaozhe Ren, Yulong Li, Zhipeng Zhang, Hang Wang, Zhaohui Xu, Rui Zhao, Yibo He, Xinzhuang Niu | published=2026-06-04 | primary_category=cs.CL | id=2606.05868]\n  2. How and Where to Translate? The Impact of Translation Strategies in Cross-lingual LLM Prompting\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.22923\n     [authors=Aman Gupta, Yingying Zhuang, Zhou Yu, Ziji Zhang, Anurag Beniwal | published=2025-07-21 | primary_category=cs.CL | id=2507.22923]\n  3. DMN-Guided Prompting: A Framework for Controlling LLM Behavior\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.11701\n     [authors=Shaghayegh Abedi, Amin Jalali | published=2025-05-16 | primary_category=cs.AI | id=2505.11701]\n  4. Online Primal-Dual Methods with Measurement Feedback for Time-Varying Convex Optimization\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.05159\n     [authors=Andrey Bernstein, Emiliano Dall'Anese, Andrea Simonetto | published=2018-04-14 | primary_category=math.OC | id=1804.05159]\n  5. Automated Prompt Generation for Creative and Counterfactual Text-to-image Synthesis\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.21375\n     [authors=Aleksa Jelaca, Ying Jiao, Chang Tian, Marie-Francine Moens | published=2025-09-23 | primary_category=cs.CV | id=2509.21375]\n\n=== openalex (5 results) ===\n  1. Harnessing the Power of LLMs in Practice: A Survey on ChatGPT and Beyond\n     https://openalex.org/W4392240262\n     [rank=1 | id=W4392240262]\n  2. A Survey of Large Language Models\n     https://openalex.org/W4362515116\n     [rank=2 | id=W4362515116]\n  3. Towards Mitigating LLM Hallucination via Self Reflection\n     https://openalex.org/W4389519928\n     [rank=3 | id=W4389519928]\n  4. A Review of Current Trends, Techniques, and Challenges in Large Language Models (LLMs)\n     https://openalex.org/W4392358084\n     [rank=4 | id=W4392358084]\n  5. MM-LLMs: Recent Advances in MultiModal Large Language Models\n     https://openalex.org/W4402670135\n     [rank=5 | id=W4402670135]\n\n=== openreview (5 results) ===\